    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to the underground arena, where chaos meets competition.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're on a mission, dig through destructible caves packed with minerals, power-ups, and rival moles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mine resources, outsmart your opponents, and deposit your minerals in this fast-paced party brawler for 2\u20138 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight, blast, and jetpack your way through frantic matches as you race to fill the cart\u2014but watch out, rivals will do anything to steal your haul.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dig &amp; Destroy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tunnel through dynamic, randomly generated maps where no two matches are the same. Shape the battlefield as you dig, fight, and sabotage your way to victory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build Your Loadout, Your Way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mix and match unique tools, gadgets. Master your favorite combo or counter your friends' strategies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Chaotic PvP Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle up to seven other moles in free-for-all or team-based brawls online. Outplay, out-smart, and out-mine your rivals in unpredictable underground arenas.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Built for Party Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grab a controller and jump into fast-paced online matches with friends, bots or strangers. Mineral Madness supports full controller setups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to the underground arena, where chaos meets competition.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're on a mission, dig through destructible caves packed with minerals, power-ups, and rival moles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mine resources, outsmart your opponents, and deposit your minerals in this fast-paced party brawler for 2\u20138 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight, blast, and jetpack your way through frantic matches as you race to fill the cart\u2014but watch out, rivals will do anything to steal your haul.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dig &amp; Destroy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tunnel through dynamic, randomly generated maps where no two matches are the same. Shape the battlefield as you dig, fight, and sabotage your way to victory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build Your Loadout, Your Way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mix and match unique tools, gadgets. Master your favorite combo or counter your friends' strategies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Chaotic PvP Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle up to seven other moles in free-for-all or team-based brawls online. Outplay, out-smart, and out-mine your rivals in unpredictable underground arenas.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Built for Party Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grab a controller and jump into fast-paced online matches with friends, bots or strangers. Mineral Madness supports full controller setups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
